{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1884","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Counting Rhyme"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array of integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A pair of integers $$$(i, j)$$$, such that $$$1 \\le i \\lt j \\le n$$$, is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", if there "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"does not exist"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" an integer $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le k \\le n$$$) such that $$$a_i$$$ is divisible by $$$a_k$$$ and $$$a_j$$$ is divisible by $$$a_k$$$ at the same time."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please, find the number of good pairs."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 2 \\cdot 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output the number of good pairs."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n4\n2 4 4 4\n4\n2 3 4 4\n9\n6 8 9 4 6 8 9 4 9\n9\n7 7 4 4 9 9 6 2 9\n18\n10 18 18 15 14 4 5 6 8 9 10 12 15 16 18 17 13 11\n21\n12 19 19 18 18 12 2 18 19 12 12 3 12 12 12 18 19 16 18 19 12\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n3\n26\n26\n124\n82\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, there are no good pairs. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, here are all the good pairs: $$$(1, 2)$$$, $$$(2, 3)$$$, and $$$(2, 4)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1884D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1884/problem/D"}